      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        517,
        699,
        1298,
        737
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York recognizes the need to continue to provide various\nservices to the residents of the City in its parks and public recreation areas; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2163,
          "min": -1.0557
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 33,
          "mean": -0.0162,
          "min": -0.5275
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6366,
        "area_px": 30654,
        "density": 0.20767,
        "chars": 164,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        517,
        737,
        1298,
        775
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is desirable that certain of these public services be operated under contract\nwith the City by persons and corporations qualified to operate such services; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1706,
          "min": -0.993
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 31,
          "mean": -0.0207,
          "min": -0.6331
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6582,
        "area_px": 29868,
        "density": 0.22037,
        "chars": 171,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        517,
        775,
        1298,
        813
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is in the best interest of The City of New York and its residents that\nsuch services be delivered to the residents of the City in the best possible manner; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1823,
          "min": -1.0859
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.001,
          "min": -0.0193
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6227,
        "area_px": 30654,
        "density": 0.20314,
        "chars": 171,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        517,
        812,
        1298,
        869
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Revenues are derived by the City from the sale of services to the public\nby such persons and corporations and it is desirable that the revenues be as large as possible,\nconsistent with proper park use; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1575,
          "min": -0.7783
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 45,
          "mean": -0.0033,
          "min": -0.143
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7820,
        "area_px": 45588,
        "density": 0.17154,
        "chars": 214,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.37
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        517,
        868,
        1298,
        906
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is to the best interest of the City that the Department of Parks and\nRecreation solicit proposals for future concessions.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1638,
          "min": -0.9722
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0016,
          "min": -0.0232
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4806,
        "area_px": 30654,
        "density": 0.15678,
        "chars": 133,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        519,
        906,
        1298,
        943
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by virtue of the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New\nYork, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1745,
          "min": -1.0109
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0005
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 29,
          "mean": -0.0036,
          "min": -0.1006
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4322,
        "area_px": 29792,
        "density": 0.14507,
        "chars": 118,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.3
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        556,
        943,
        1300,
        1037
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is established a Committee for the review of Department of\nParks and Recreation concession agreements. This Committee shall consist of the\nCommissioner of Parks and Recreation, who shall be the Chairman, the Director of\nManagement and Budget, and the Corporation Counsel. The Comptroller shall also\nbe invited to serve as a member of the Committee.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1827,
          "min": -1.0525
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.4308,
          "min": -0.4308
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 74,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0499
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14228,
        "area_px": 70406,
        "density": 0.20209,
        "chars": 365,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.65
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        593,
        1038,
        1251,
        1057
      ],
      "category": "Section-header",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. This Committee shall have the following functions, powers and duties:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1659,
          "min": -1.046
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.1484,
          "min": -0.2967
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 16,
          "mean": -0.0059,
          "min": -0.0651
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2825,
        "area_px": 13240,
        "density": 0.21337,
        "chars": 74,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        574,
        1057,
        1300,
        1112
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) To recommend approval or disapproval of each future proposed concession\nlicense which is expected to have estimated gross annual receipts in excess of seventy-\nfive thousand dollars;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1565,
          "min": -1.0402
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0025
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0215,
          "min": -0.6938
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7289,
        "area_px": 40936,
        "density": 0.17806,
        "chars": 186,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.52
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        574,
        1112,
        1300,
        1187
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(b) To review and evaluate any other present or future concession agreements\nregardless of the estimated gross receipts, wherein the Commissioner of Parks and\nRecreation shall determine that such solicitation for proposals is consistent with\nthe City's desire to maximize potential revenues.",
      "logprob_stats": {
